        "accession_number": "0001371285-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our data-driven, vertically-integrated approach, we develop and offer high-value medical insurance products, priced to take into account each pet’s unique characteristics and coverage level.",
        "start_character": 255,
        "end_character": 453
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001371285-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001371285-26-000018-937462a3b5166e87",
        "accession_number": "0001371285-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to continue pursuing opportunities to provide pet parents with complementary products and services.",
        "start_character": 13234,
        "end_character": 13343
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001371285-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001371285-26-000018-937462a3b5166e87",
        "accession_number": "0001371285-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate in two reporting segments: subscription business and other business.",
        "start_character": 551,
        "end_character": 630
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001371285-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001371285-26-000018-937462a3b5166e87",
        "accession_number": "0001371285-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate our subscription business segment similar to other subscription-based businesses, with a focus on achieving a target margin prior to our new pet acquisition expense and acquiring as many pets as possible at our targeted average estimated internal rate of return.",
        "start_character": 804,
        "end_character": 1077
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001371285-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001371285-26-000018-937462a3b5166e87",
        "accession_number": "0001371285-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide a full suite of services and support for these products and they are designed to align with the target margin profile of our subscription business segment.",
        "start_character": 1495,
        "end_character": 1661
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001371285-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001371285-26-000018-937462a3b5166e87",
        "accession_number": "0001371285-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Within our subscription business, we also provide \"Powered by Trupanion\" pet insurance product offerings marketed by third parties, low and medium average revenue per pet products marketed under the brand names Furkin and PHI Direct in Canada, and a Trupanion branded product in Germany and Switzerland.",
        "start_character": 1078,
        "end_character": 1381
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001371285-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001371285-26-000018-937462a3b5166e87",
        "accession_number": "0001371285-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result, we are focused primarily on expanding the overall size of our markets by providing pet parents with high value, transparent medical coverage designed for each pet's unique characteristics and coverage level.",
        "start_character": 15393,
        "end_character": 15613
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001371285-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001371285-26-000018-937462a3b5166e87",
        "accession_number": "0001371285-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The vast majority of pet parents in the markets in which we operate do not currently have medical insurance for their pets and those that do have medical insurance for their pets do not typically move from one insurance company to another because pre-existing conditions would likely not be covered following a move.",
        "start_character": 15076,
        "end_character": 15392
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001371285-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001371285-26-000018-937462a3b5166e87",
        "accession_number": "0001371285-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Through the use of our proprietary, patented software designed to communicate directly with a veterinary hospital’s practice management system, we are able to offer a differentiated experience to our members.",
        "start_character": 6840,
        "end_character": 7048
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001371285-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001371285-26-000018-937462a3b5166e87",
        "accession_number": "0001371285-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also recognize the importance of family and design our benefits plans to support the physical, financial, and emotional wellbeing of team members and their families, including their pets.",
        "start_character": 20532,
        "end_character": 20722
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001371285-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001371285-26-000018-937462a3b5166e87",
        "accession_number": "0001371285-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that, over the long-term, pet insurance penetration rates in the markets in which we operate could approach those seen in the United Kingdom or Sweden where approximately 28% and 67%, respectively, of household dogs and cats are insured.",
        "start_character": 9662,
        "end_character": 9910
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001371285-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001371285-26-000018-937462a3b5166e87",
        "accession_number": "0001371285-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "As we transition more of our business to GPIC, the amount we are required to fund in this trust account will be reduced.",
        "start_character": 24683,
        "end_character": 24803
      }
